WHERE slug = 'dossier-location-frontalier-suisse-france'
  AND position($r$If the rental obstacle course discourages you, coliving offers another route. At La Villa Coliving (three houses in Ville-la-Grand, Ambilly and Annemasse, CHF 1,370 to 1,430 a month all inclusive), the file comes down to three items: a signed employment contract or job offer, an ID, and a deposit of two months' rent excluding bills. The lease is a 12-month furnished lease you can end with one month's notice, and you can move in within days if a room is free.

More than 100 residents have lived in our houses since 2021: we understand Swiss contract specifics, we think in CHF, and we know that a Geneva salary of CHF 5,000 makes an excellent tenant profile, even when traditional rental platforms don't see it that way.$r$ IN content_en) > 0
  AND position($f$If the rental obstacle course discourages you, coliving offers a radical alternative: a simplified application process (employment contract or job offer, a guarantor only case by case), an all-inclusive furnished lease, and move-in possible within days.

