UPDATE blog_posts
SET content_en = replace(content_en, $r$The permis G assumes one thing: a **stable address on the French side** and a regular return home. If you arrive without housing, proof of residence is often what holds up the application. At La Villa Coliving, for example (three houses in Ville-la-Grand, Ambilly and Annemasse, 20 min from Geneva Eaux-Vives by Léman Express, door to door), your furnished room comes with a 12-month main-residence lease that works as proof of residence, and the file comes down to three items: a signed employment contract or job offer, an ID, and a deposit of two months' rent excluding bills. You move in with housemates who work in Geneva and have been through the same steps. Discover [our houses](/en/nos-maisons).$r$, $f$The permis G assumes one thing: a **stable address on the French side** and a regular return home. That's exactly where coliving makes sense. A furnished room in a house 20 min from Geneva Eaux-Vives by Léman Express, door to door gives you a clear proof of residence, a clean lease for your paperwork, and a community of cross-border workers who already know the ropes. A solid way to secure your move while you handle the admin side. Discover [our houses](/en/nos-maisons).$f$),
    updated_at = now()
WHERE slug = 'permis-g-frontalier-geneve'
  AND position($r$The permis G assumes one thing: a **stable address on the French side** and a regular return home. If you arrive without housing, proof of residence is often what holds up the application. At La Villa Coliving, for example (three houses in Ville-la-Grand, Ambilly and Annemasse, 20 min from Geneva Eaux-Vives by Léman Express, door to door), your furnished room comes with a 12-month main-residence lease that works as proof of residence, and the file comes down to three items: a signed employment contract or job offer, an ID, and a deposit of two months' rent excluding bills. You move in with housemates who work in Geneva and have been through the same steps. Discover [our houses](/en/nos-maisons).$r$ IN content_en) > 0
  AND position($f$The permis G assumes one thing: a **stable address on the French side** and a regular return home. That's exactly where coliving makes sense. A furnished room in a house 20 min from Geneva Eaux-Vives by Léman Express, door to door gives you a clear proof of residence, a clean lease for your paperwork, and a community of cross-border workers who already know the ropes. A solid way to secure your move while you handle the admin side. Discover [our houses](/en/nos-maisons).$f$ IN content_en) = 0;

